        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nicholas Boshier, Christiaan Van Vuuren, Jarod Green, Macfarlane\n- Products: Beached Az, Soul Mates\n- Organizations: Australian Broadcasting Corporation (ABC), ABC2\n- Roles: actor, voice actor\n\nFacts:\n- Nicholas Boshier is an Australian actor.\n- Nicholas Boshier, Macfarlane, and Jarod Green developed the cartoon Beached Az.\n- Nicholas Boshier voiced the main whale character in Beached Az.\n- Beached Az is an animated cartoon series broadcast by the Australian Broadcasting Corporation (ABC).\n- Soul Mates is an Australian comedy series starring Christiaan Van Vuuren and Nicholas Boshier.\n- Soul Mates was screened on ABC2.",
